WEBVTT

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:42.080
Excuse me.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:45.590
Ah, Chiaki! Come on in.

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:48.210
Hello, Kumada-sensei.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:50.850
Sit down, I've got just the thing for you.

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:53.850
Before you go on, can I borrow a thermometer?

00:01:54.430 --> 00:01:55.290
Here you go.

00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:57.020
Thanks, I was feeling a bit feverish.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.990
Well, it is a warm spring.

00:01:59.990 --> 00:02:02.450
As always with the trite comments.

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:03.820
More importantly, I have something to talk to you about.

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:08.060
It's about your homeroom teacher, Tanaka-sensei, and...

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:09.030
Oh, let's see.

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:14.900
36.9º C? Maybe you should rest for a bit.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:18.270
If it's just that, then... I think I will head back.

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:21.200
Oops, sorry, I was wrong! It's 37.1º C!

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:26.950
Actually, it's a little less than 37.19º C,
so rest here for five minutes.

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:31.510
Fine. I guess I'll rest for a little while.

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:35.030
So, what do you want with Tanaka-sensei?

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:38.520
Oh yeah! Tanaka-sensei is pretty amazing, isn't he?

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:43.990
"It just so happens that Nurse Kumada is still single."

00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:45.220
Would you tell him that for me?

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:47.900
Such a scheming woman...

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:50.290
I'll think about it.

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:52.240
Really? Great!

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:54.530
Ah, do you want some ramune?

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:56.620
Somehow it looks scary, so it's okay.

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.370
Sensei...

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:01.980
I'm feeling a little dizzy.

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:05.360
Yeah? Doesn't seem like a fever though.

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:10.940
Just to be sure, I'll give you some medicine. Your hand.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:11.740
All right.

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:16.310
I feel so much better!

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:18.180
Good! Do your best in your afternoon classes!

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:19.720
Okay!

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:22.810
Wasn't that ramune?

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:26.400
It's fine. It's all psychological anyway.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:27.630
Not bad...

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:31.010
I'll be going back now.

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:33.630
What is it?

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:35.950
I'm counting on you for the first aid stuff at the sports festival.

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:44.960
Hey, Minami-san...

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:46.920
What is it?

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:55.470
Please look after me tomorrow as well.

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:57.040
Sure.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:02.570
I'm home.

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:03.690
Welcome back.

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:05.400
You've been coming home pretty late these days.

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:08.650
You're not doing anything weird, are you?

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:12.990
I'm in charge of the sports festival, so I've been really busy.

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:14.190
That's it?

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.320
Should there be something else?

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:18.410
What?! Boring!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.410
What are you in charge of, Chiaki?

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:23.900
I'm in charge of first aid.

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:27.540
But I wonder why they're having a sports festival during this term.

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:31.420
I guess elementary schools nowadays have really changed.

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:33.260
You don't need to tell me that.

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:36.010
I'm looking forward to the sports festival.

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:37.310
Yes.

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.550
Ugh, this is really bothersome.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:47.520
I want to go home soon.

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:52.730
Quit moving your mouth and move your hands already. You're only a little late going home.

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:57.280
Hey, wait up!

00:04:57.280 --> 00:05:00.110
Don't leave me behind!

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:01.990
And whose fault do you think that is?

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:05.160
Chiaki!

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.820
Could it be that you hate him?

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:16.300
Why are you asking such a thing?

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:21.000
Isn't that a little cold? You're neighbors, but you go home-

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:25.400
Being neighbors is purely coincidental. Do we really have to go home together?

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:29.060
That's not quite what I meant...

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:37.490
And... start!

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:43.620
Good! Doesn't it feel great?

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:45.370
One more time!

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:47.790
We're still going at it?

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.580
I'm already at my limit.

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:55.380
Welcome back, Chiaki!

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:57.610
What are you guys doing?

00:05:57.610 --> 00:05:59.690
Kana-chan called us.

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:02.350
Hey, we're in the middle of special training for the sports festival.

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:06.050
Hey, no resting! Our special training hasn't ended yet!

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:08.230
What, there's still more?

00:06:08.230 --> 00:06:10.010
Of course!

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:12.260
If you don't work hard there will be no victory.

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:16.480
For a special event like a sports festival, you only need a few intensive workouts to have a good showing!

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.060
Yes, coach.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:24.350
All right, then...

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:27.580
Chiaki, want to join us?

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.900
I won't be joining you.

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:43.550
Your sister and the others look like they're having fun.

00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:45.550
She's just an idiot.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:52.770
Minami-san.

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:55.390
What is it?

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:59.900
If you have something to say, hurry up and say it.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:01.860
Umm...

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:05.570
See you.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:06.870
Minami-san.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:10.370
Let's make this a really fun sports festival.

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:12.910
What's this all of a sudden?

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:15.620
Then I'll see you tomorrow.

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:22.200
Doesn't speak very clearly, does he?

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:23.890
I don't understand him at all.

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:46.700
Hey, do you mind if I leave these up to you?

00:07:47.470 --> 00:07:49.200
Sure, I'll do them for you.

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:51.200
Thank you!

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:10.070
It'd be nice if the rain stopped, wouldn't it?

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:15.730
Don't worry. The weather report said tomorrow will be sunny.

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:35.370
I heard today that our neighbors are moving again.

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:36.580
What?!

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:41.590
Where are you going?

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:43.080
Next door.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:47.300
There's manga I haven't read yet, so I thought I'd borrow them. You know, before he packs.

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:49.220
Don't do that.

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:51.300
But...!

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:52.430
Don't do that.

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:56.960
I'll do it tomorrow.

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:06.110
I want them. I really do want them. He was a pretty useful guy too...

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:09.890
Even after we finally started getting along...

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:24.420
Damn, there's still this much left to do...

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:28.160
I'll do them, so leave it to me for today.

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:28.940
Really?

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:30.680
You really shouldn't spoil her like that.

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:36.340
Fuyuki, fold the tissues. Touma, open them up and make flowers.

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:38.940
I'll be in charge of stringing them together.

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:41.710
But I already said that I'd do it.

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:43.940
If three people work on it, it'll be done quickly.

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:46.150
That's true, but...

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:48.650
Move your hands more than your lips.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:49.860
Okay, okay.

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:54.160
By the way, Minami-san...

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:59.210
You know, it's a bit late, but we're both Minami-san.

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:02.090
That's right!

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:02.990
Sorry.

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:05.150
It's nothing to apologize for.

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:06.660
You can call me Touma.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:09.470
I don't mind if you call me Chiaki either.

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:11.570
Really?

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:16.180
Thank you, Chiaki...san. Touma-kun.

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:19.390
Kun?! I'm a girl!

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:22.020
Sorry, Touma-san!

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:25.860
Somehow, that also sounds disgusting.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:38.830
And... start!

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:41.290
Oh, come on! Put all your heart into it and go!

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:53.300
Oh? A sports festival, and your neighbor is moving too?

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:57.190
As always, there are a lot of events going on.

00:10:57.190 --> 00:10:58.500
I guess so.

00:10:58.500 --> 00:10:59.270
It's spring too, right?

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:02.520
I don't think the seasons have anything to do with it, though.

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:10.030
Even if they have nothing to do with it... there's still someone looking forward to the next one.

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:14.030
Haruka, are you participating in anything?

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:17.410
There are events for parents and older siblings, aren't there?

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:21.040
I'm not sure yet. I haven't really asked Chiaki or anything.

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:24.250
You're relaxed as always, aren't you?

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:25.750
Really?

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:28.090
Oh?

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:31.550
Minami Haruka will be going to a sports festival? If that's the case...

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:36.940
I think Chiaki-chan would be delighted.

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:38.150
He left...
I think Chiaki-chan would be delighted.

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:38.790
What?

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:40.430
Ah! It's nothing.

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:42.940
Then, I'll be leaving first.

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.730
I have to go to my club activities.

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:53.960
Made it just in time.

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:54.770
Yeah.

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:06.250
Then I'll see you tomorrow.

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:14.470
Food's ready.

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:17.940
Wow! Today's quite a feast!

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:20.220
Yes, because tomorrow is the sports festival, isn't it?

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:23.740
Thank you very much, Haruka-neesama.

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:25.770
I'll be sure to properly cheer you on, okay?

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:27.470
You don't have to come.

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:31.180
Don't say such things! It's the family's duty to support you at the festival!

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:32.990
Family...

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:38.560
Having everybody together for support makes sports festivals so exciting. Isn't that right, Haruka?

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:39.240
It sure is.

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:41.740
Gathering the entire family...

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:44.250
It'd be nice if it were sunny tomorrow.

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:46.000
It would.

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:15.440
We will be beginning the opening ceremony for the sports festival shortly.

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:17.720
It's begun, hasn't it?

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:21.160
Leave the food to me, Minami Haruka.

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:36.300
Found you at last.

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:40.440
Oh? Fujioka. Why are you here?

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.420
I got called here.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.720
But none of us called you.

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:45.890
It doesn't matter.

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:48.440
Why don't you cheer them with us, Fujioka-kun?

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:49.420
Sure!

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:55.480
This is program number 5, the fifth-year 100 meter dash.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:56.690
Chiaki and the others are running.

00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:01.200
All right! Uchida, Yoshino, show me the results of your special training!

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:03.790
On your marks.

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:05.160
Get set.

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:37.280
Do it yourself, idiots.

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:43.990
Will all fifth-year students in the scavenger hunt race please assemble now?

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:12.650
Why did you bring Kana along?

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.650
Well, that's...

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:18.650
There wasn't anybody else I could think of for it.

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:21.770
Then why did you bring Fujioka too?

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:23.610
Let me see!

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:27.570
F-Father?!

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:29.760
Fujioka is...?

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:33.120
This is too much!

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:34.170
I'm a father? But I'm just a middle schooler.

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:38.340
Fujioka is a father! Or maybe papa?
I'm a father? But I'm just a middle schooler.

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:43.080
Next, a representative from each of the classes will be in a costume parade.

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:46.320
Who's the representative from our class?

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:47.100
Makoto-kun.

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:50.930
Mako-chan?

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:55.600
...looks a lot like a cross-dressing Makoto-kun.

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:57.800
I wonder about that...

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:02.320
This concludes the morning program.

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:07.440
Where are you going?

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:12.540
I thought I'd go to the classroom to eat lunch.

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:14.960
Nobody is coming with you?

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:15.710
No.

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:18.290
Want to eat together?

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:22.720
But then I'd feel bad.

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:30.750
Here, help yourselves.

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:32.060
Let's eat!

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:35.520
You haven't done anything special so don't be the first to eat!

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:38.020
Cheering you on uses up energy, you know.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:41.420
Fuyuki-kun, don't hesitate and eat some food.

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:42.990
Okay, thank you very much.

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:49.740
Fuyuki-kun?

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:54.000
Oh, it's just that this is the first time I've had a bento together with everybody.

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.500
Eat a lot, okay?

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:59.330
You'll end up crying if you don't eat quickly.

00:17:03.650 --> 00:17:08.140
Oh yeah, there's an event for parents and older siblings in the afternoon. What'll you do about it?

00:17:09.950 --> 00:17:13.220
Eh? Is there really? I didn't hear about it.

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:15.600
I wasn't planning on asking you.

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:17.820
Then Haruka is participating in it?

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:18.620
Yes.

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:21.710
So mean! I want to join too!

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:24.300
You did in the scavenger hunt, didn't you?

00:17:24.300 --> 00:17:26.470
I want to join more things!

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:28.610
That's right! Why don't I join with you?

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:31.830
C'mon, c'mon. It's okay, right?

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:34.210
I suppose so...

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:35.220
You there.

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:35.540
Yes?

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:40.290
Just what kind of relationship do you have with Minami?

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:41.920
Huh?

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:48.430
I've prepared the greatest handmade pasta for a day like this.

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:50.620
If I don't boil it right, it won't turn out its best.

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:54.560
Napolitan please.

00:17:54.890 --> 00:17:55.770
Yes!

00:17:56.170 --> 00:18:02.810
Due to the beginning of the afternoon program, students should please return to their positions.

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:13.030
Let's do our best, Chiaki.

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:15.730
Yes!

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:27.420
Here we go.

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:29.090
Yes, Haruka-neesama.

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:37.060
Next, program number 25, fifth-year students and their parents in a three-legged race.

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:39.250
On your marks.

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:40.260
Get set.

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:47.170
Don't be so nervous.

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:48.150
Okay.

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:36.290
The sports festival has now concluded.

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:37.370
Do you have carbonara?

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:38.310
Coming right up!

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:39.310
Is the bolognese still not done?

00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:40.410
Please wait a few moments.

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:44.830
Isn't it okay to clean up later?

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:47.620
Don't complain and just do it quickly.

00:19:48.780 --> 00:19:52.460
Why weren't you here until the end, Fuyuki?

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:53.180
What about Fuyuki?

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:54.130
Oh?

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:55.160
What is it?

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:56.300
He transferred schools today.

00:19:58.460 --> 00:19:59.770
Didn't you hear?

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:04.880
He couldn't help it, and could only be around during the morning.

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:07.900
It would've been nice if he could've stayed until the very end.

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:16.200
Minami-san...

00:20:23.810 --> 00:20:26.770
If you have something to say, say it properly.

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:28.710
You idiot.

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:37.720
It's so cold! Isn't it spring yet?

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:40.720
Really, you just whine from the morning on.

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:43.140
If it's really cold, what's so bad about saying so?

00:20:43.140 --> 00:20:45.140
Will it get warmer if you say it?

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:48.860
Then I'll make something warm for an afternoon snack, okay?

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:51.280
Classes end at noon today, anyway.

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:53.530
Again? It's unfair that only Haruka gets off at noon!

00:20:53.530 --> 00:20:55.820
Eh? Even if you tell me that...

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:58.570
I've decided that, today especially, I will go home early.

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:00.740
Do whatever you want.

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:03.790
Hey you! Quit ignoring me!

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:17.810
Sensei, did you decide who the exchange student would be?

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:20.430
Yes, we're letting Minami-san go.

00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:21.380
Huh?

00:21:27.870 --> 00:21:30.620
Why didn't she tell us anything?

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:33.140
Maybe she has her reasons for it?

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:39.820
We should probably throw her a farewell party.

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:41.220
Yeah...

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:44.790
High school students sure have it nice.

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:48.940
Kana-chan? This is a good moment, come in here.

00:21:53.280 --> 00:21:56.510
Haruka is... You're joking, right?

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:58.710
I haven't heard anything!

00:23:30.330 --> 00:23:33.640
A small amount of vinegar is actually a big help in washing clothes.

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:36.470
Instead of fabric softener, putting in only a little will make them soft.

00:23:36.630 --> 00:23:39.340
The smell of vinegar won't be left in the clothes, so don't worry.

00:23:39.340 --> 00:23:41.510
The vinegar also works well in removing stains.

00:23:41.510 --> 00:23:44.760
In my opinion, it's much better, so try it for yourself.
